
metadata:
  book_id: "musnad-ibn-umar"
  book_name: "Musnad Abdullah ibn Umar"
  total_hadiths: "97"
  available_languages: "ar,bn,bs,de,en,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr,ur"
  ai_translated_languages: "bn,bs,de,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr"
  ai_translation_note: "The following languages are machine-assisted translations from the Arabic via LLM, disclosed per-row with an [AI-translation] prefix: bn,bs,de,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr. All other languages are human/scholarly translations."
  intro: "The Musnad of Abdullah ibn Umar (d. 73 AH), the eminent Companion and prolific narrator, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ar: "مسند عبد الله بن عمر (ت 73هـ)، الصحابي الجليل والمكثر من الرواية، يجمع مروياته عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم. يُعرض هنا في 97 حديثا بالعربية والإنجليزية والأردية."
  intro_en: "The Musnad of Abdullah ibn Umar (d. 73 AH), the eminent Companion and prolific narrator, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ur: "مسند عبداللہ بن عمر (م 73ھ)، جلیل القدر صحابی اور کثیر الروایت راوی، ان کی نبی کریم صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم سے مروی روایات کا مجموعہ ہے۔ یہاں 97 احادیث عربی، انگریزی اور اردو کے ساتھ پیش ہیں۔"
  intro_bn: "The Musnad of Abdullah ibn Umar (d. 73 AH), the eminent Companion and prolific narrator, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him). Presented here in 97 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
